</head><body><%- include('../partials/site-header') %>
<div class="page-header"><div class="container"><div class="page-header-box"><h2>Ocean Freight</h2><nav><ol class="breadcrumb"><li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li><li><a href="service.html">Services</a></li><li>Ocean Freight</li></ol></nav></div></div></div>
<main class="service-detail-page"><div class="container"><div class="row service-detail-layout">
<aside class="col-lg-4"><div class="service-sidebar"><div class="service-nav-card"><h3>Freight Services</h3><ul>
<li><a class="active" href="ocean-freight.html">Ocean Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="air-freight.html">Air Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="cargo-freight.html">Cargo Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="express-delivery.html">Express Delivery <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="customs-clearance.html">Customs Clearance <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="project-cargo.html">Project Cargo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="pet-transport.html">Pet Transport <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
</ul></div><div class="service-help-card"><h3>Shipping by sea?</h3><p>Tell us what you’re shipping, its volume, the route, and your preferred delivery dates.</p><a href="contact.html">Plan Your Shipment <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a></div></div></aside>
<div class="col-lg-8"><div class="service-main-image"><img src="/images/service-1.jpg" alt="Container vessel carrying international ocean freight"></div>
<section class="service-overview"><div class="service-kicker">Connected sea transport</div><h1>Sea freight planned around your shipment</h1><p>Ocean freight suits many large-volume, recurring, and budget-conscious international shipments. <%= business.name %> coordinates containerized and general cargo, with clear stages from departure to arrival.</p><p>We help select a shipping option, prepare shipment information, and coordinate the carrier journey. Where required, we connect sea transport with collection, customs support, and final delivery.</p></section>
<section class="service-features"><h2 class="service-section-title">Your ocean freight options</h2><div class="row g-4">
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked"></i><h3>Full container loads</h3><p>A container dedicated to your shipment, suited to larger loads or specific loading needs.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i><h3>Shared container loads</h3><p>Shared container space for smaller loads that do not need a full container.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines"></i><h3>Booking and document support</h3><p>Help with booking details, cargo paperwork, transfers, and shipment updates.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-ramp-box"></i><h3>Port-to-door coordination</h3><p>Connected planning for collection, port handling, customs, and onward transport.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="service-process"><h2 class="service-section-title">Your shipment, step by step</h2><div class="row g-4">
<div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">01</div><h3>Review</h3><p>We review your cargo, route, schedule, and handling requirements.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">02</div><h3>Plan</h3><p>We set out the transport plan and required paperwork.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">03</div><h3>Move</h3><p>We coordinate loading and the sea transport stage.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">04</div><h3>Deliver</h3><p>We arrange arrival handling and the next delivery stage.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="service-faqs"><h2 class="service-section-title">Questions about sea freight</h2><div class="accordion" id="oceanFaq">
<div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#oceanOne">Do I need a full container or shared space?</button></h3><div id="oceanOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#oceanFaq"><div class="accordion-body">That depends on the cargo’s volume, dimensions, handling needs, route, and timing. We review these details before suggesting an option.</div></div></div>
<div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#oceanTwo">What should I send for a shipping quote?</button></h3><div id="oceanTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#oceanFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Share the origin, destination, cargo type, package count, weight, dimensions, ready date, and special handling needs.</div></div></div>
<div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#oceanThree">Can you arrange delivery after the sea journey?</button></h3><div id="oceanThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#oceanFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Yes, subject to the route and agreed service. We can connect ocean freight with collection, customs support, and inland delivery.</div></div></div>
</div></section><div class="service-cta"><div><h2>Plan your next sea shipment</h2><p>Talk to us about a route and shipping option for your cargo.</p></div><a href="/quote?service=ocean_freight" class="btn-default">Request a Quote</a></div>
</div></div></div></main><%- include('../partials/site-footer') %>
<script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script><script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script><script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script><script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script></body></html>
